WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.146
- When you say that passion
is the ingredient that

00:00:03.146 --> 00:00:05.081
most matters in success,

00:00:05.081 --> 00:00:07.822
I agree but here's 
how I think about it.

00:00:07.822 --> 00:00:10.386
Without passion nobody,

00:00:10.386 --> 00:00:13.308
if Tony Hawk wasn't passionate
about skateboarding,

00:00:13.308 --> 00:00:14.527
if I wasn't passionate about

00:00:14.527 --> 00:00:16.909
becoming one of the great 
entrepreneurs of a generation,

00:00:16.909 --> 00:00:19.665
If LeBron wasn't 
passionate about basketball,

00:00:19.665 --> 00:00:22.674
they wouldn't have put in,
I wouldn't have put in

00:00:22.674 --> 00:00:25.550
the hours, the work.

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:29.784
When it all makes no sense,
when it's 10:30 at night tonight

00:00:29.784 --> 00:00:31.788
and I've got to go to 
one more meeting

00:00:31.788 --> 00:00:35.922
but I got to wake up at 5:30
and if I didn't have the passion

00:00:35.922 --> 00:00:37.957
for the game, I wouldn't to it.

00:00:37.957 --> 00:00:38.773
I would cancel it.

00:00:38.773 --> 00:00:40.847
I wouldn't have booked 
it in the first place.

00:00:40.847 --> 00:00:45.143
And so, it becomes the gateway 
drug religion that allows you to

00:00:45.143 --> 00:00:46.303
do the tactical things.

00:00:46.303 --> 00:00:48.668
I have a vision to where 
we're going in the future.

00:00:48.668 --> 00:00:52.422
I come up with stuff every day
that very few people are

00:00:52.422 --> 00:00:56.223
thinking about and then 
in parallel, this is one of the

00:00:56.223 --> 00:00:58.833
biggest reasons I still 
have a personal brand,

00:00:58.833 --> 00:01:02.669
I use Instagram and Snapchat

00:01:02.669 --> 00:01:06.410
and Facebook and Twitter 
every single day.

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:09.131
I'm a practitioner.
I get my hands dirty.

00:01:09.131 --> 00:01:12.470
I'm the architect
and the mason.

